Thus many needed predicates are already true.

Goal: candidate_created shift_candidate_beta: not true initially. Need to create shift_candidate_beta (type candidate_entity). Action create_candidate with ?candidate - candidate_entity. Precondition: not (candidate_created ?candidate) and not (dispatched ?candidate). So we can do create_candidate shift_candidate_beta.

Goal: compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha: already true.

