Similarly we need destination_node_ready? Actually for marking origin availability dispatch ready we need destination_node_ready? No, mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready requires transport_leg_assembled and transport_leg_loading_authorized, but not destination node ready. However to assemble transport leg we need origin_node_ready and destination_node_ready (for assemble_transport_leg). So we also need destination_node_ready. That requires activate_destination_node action (similar). So we need to prepare destination_availability_alpha as well? Actually we need destination_node_ready for transport leg assembly. But we may not need to dispatch destination_availability_alpha (goal doesn't require dispatched destination_availability). However we need destination_node_ready for transport leg assembly. So we need to activate destination node.

