Now we need to ensure compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha is true. We assigned it to shift_candidate_alpha at step 18, then used it in step 28 (establish_clearance_nominal) which does not consume it (the action does not remove the link). Actually establish_clearance_nominal does not have any negative effect on compliance_certificate_linked; it just adds candidate_clearance_established and route_sequence_context_set. So the link remains. So after step 28, compliance_certificate is still linked to shift_candidate_alpha. To make it available, we need to release it via release_compliance_certificate.

